## What this register does not cover

A retrofit of ~60 load-bearing figures — 63 rows against a 3 MB+ corpus holding thousands of values. Breadth over exhaustiveness, chosen deliberately. **No artifact literal was given a `register_id`**, so traceability runs register → artifact via `consumed_by`, not artifact → register via an inline id. Nothing was researched; no artifact figure changed. The country is still not closed — the six blockers and eleven majors of §§3–4 are untouched, and §1I.3 adds one CARRIED item.
